{
  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "& Sertorius w\u00e6s \u00dea underfeng Pompeius Partha gewin, for \u00feon Metre\u00featis heora cyning teah him to \u00fea l\u00e6ssan Ac hiene Pompeius of eallum \u00fe\u00e6m londe afliemde, & hiene bedraf on Armenie, & him Hit is ungeliefedlic to secganne, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, hw\u00e6t on \u00fe\u00e6m gewinne forwear\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hie w\u00e6ron \u00dea Pompeius hamweard w\u00e6s, \u00fea noldan him \u00fea londleode \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten aliefan \u00e6t Hierusalem. Him w\u00e6ron on fultume XXII cyninga. \u00dea het Pompeius \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten br\u00e6ce, & on fuhte d\u00e6ges & nihtes, simle an legie \u00e6fter \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s Iudea ofslagen XIII M. & mon towearp \u00feone weal ni\u00feer o\u00fe \u00feone grund. & mon l\u00e6dde Aristobolus to Rome gebundenne; se w\u00e6s \u00e6g\u00feer ge heora cyning ge heora biscop. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s VI hund wintra & LXVII, Romane gesealdon Gaiuse \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee he hie oferwunnen h\u00e6fde, he for on Bretanie \u00fe\u00e6t iglond, & wi\u00f0 \u00fea Brettas gefeaht, Ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s he gefeaht wi\u00fe \u00fea Brettas eft on Centlonde, & hie wurdon gefliemede. Heora \u00feridde gefeoht w\u00e6s neah \u00fe\u00e6re ie \u00fee mon h\u00e6t Temes, neh \u00fe\u00e6m forda \u00fee mon h\u00e6t \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte him eode on hond se cyning & \u00fea burgware \u00fee w\u00e6ron on Cirenceastre, & \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Iulius for to Rome, & b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t him mon brohte \u00feone triumphan",
